            "notes": "Keep playing as i told you on the first Round 1 notes , you're almost the lobby admin at this point.\n\n***Don't forget to read Optional items notes to understand each way to play !***\n\nFor me if you have enough money [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) + [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) + [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) is just the best combo.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nVS BEAM only : Against [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) or Multiple beam in one match like : [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed) + [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) + [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) : Take [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) and you can go for [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) + [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) item and if you have enough money go for [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)",
