            "notes": "At this point if you are dominating in term of cash i recommand to sell your armor and going for maximum Weapon Power / Attack speed\n\n[Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429)  give you a lot of bonus damage after using [Boosters](ability_f8b09a55-efe2-4f1f-8abe-9a31fca0f541) and [Micro Missiles](ability_706d5186-2b4a-4813-97d6-c36864cc3491) against any target especially TANK. You can burst a lot with it and confirm some target.\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is more regular in term of dps if you don't like playstyle around [Micro Missiles](ability_706d5186-2b4a-4813-97d6-c36864cc3491) dive and [Boosters](ability_f8b09a55-efe2-4f1f-8abe-9a31fca0f541). Also give you 25 Armor and steal 10% atk speed on enemy.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nVS BEAM only : Against [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0) or Multiple beam in one match like : [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed) + [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) + [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88) : Your build is now set up since core item are [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) + [Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144) so now you should take [Stat Boost](item_d3ef725b-3183-417c-bc5a-76bfa21c6cc5) power instead of [Focused Fusion](item_1123c91f-7348-4e50-aa1c-4a9961650f40). You need to abuse [Boosters](ability_f8b09a55-efe2-4f1f-8abe-9a31fca0f541) to getting back quick your [Defense Matrix](ability_88831f83-b0fd-434b-92f5-afdc1d809da2) since you can reduce damage by 65% on beam with it. Go for classic build now but you need keep Atleast [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) it's very important !",
